  <h2>The work itself</h2>

  <details>
    <summary>What kind of therapy does Reem practice?</summary>
    <div class="answer-body">
      <p>NARM for the patterns formed early in life, Somatic Experiencing for what the nervous
      system is still holding, and EMDR for specific traumatic material once there is enough
      stability. IFS-informed and Brainspotting elements are used where parts of a person
      disagree about the work.</p>
    </div>
  </details>

